# No agent watch loops

Cursor agents must **not** babysit PRs by polling. That burns tokens while GitHub Actions and squash auto-merge already own the wait.

## Forbidden in agent sessions

```sh
npm run wait-for-bots -- --watch
npm run pr:gates:check -- --watch
gh pr checks <n> --watch
while true; do npm run wait-for-bots; sleep 45; done
```

CI workflows may poll. Humans may poll. **Agents must not.**

## Required

```sh
npm run pr:arm-and-park -- --pr <n>
```

| Exit | Action |
|------|--------|
| 0 | Ready — turn may end |
| 2 | Parked (bots/CI only) — **END TURN** |
| 3 | Actionable — fix, push, re-run |
| 1 | Error |

Do not spawn pr-fix/babysit workers whose only job is to sleep until bots post.
